        r"""Return ``rank_R(M)`` (Mathlib ``Module.rank``), a cardinal.
    
        Over a field ``k`` the rank is the dimension: the cardinality of a
        basis.  A basis of cardinality ``n`` identifies ``M`` with ``k^n``
